{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14233290","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14233290","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:3:1423329001:1":{"text":"오셨군요! 미리 공부도 좀 하고, 책도 찾아봤어요. 조리도구도 챙겼고... 아무튼 필요할 것 같은 건 다 챙겼어요!","source_cn":"你们来啦！我提前做了一些功课，查阅了书籍，带了炊具……...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDB3B430653ECC86B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1423329002:1":{"text":"지도를 보니까 달이 지는 승강기에 있는 승강기로 은혜로운 평민 지역에 갈 수 있대요. 이번에는 그쪽 길로 가볼까요?","source_cn":"我看了地图，月落升降井处的升降机可以通往泽被平民区，所...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x51F6CBEF120EFD7D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1423329003:1":{"text":"오로나가 저희를 안내해 줄 것 같아요.","source_cn":"感觉欧罗娜都可以为我们带路了呢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x37F122EDF1ED6E00","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1423329004:1":{"text":"그 길은 저희도 잘 알아요. 어서 출발해요!","source_cn":"那条路线我们也很熟悉！我们出发吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA9A303203FEC8337","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:欧罗娜":{"text":"오로나","source":"欧罗娜","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"해미","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:满满":{"text":"치피","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":5,"localiz